Package: syswatch
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Darshan R <darsh@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/DARSHANR007/SysWatch
Description: Lightweight process monitor for Ubuntu
 A minimal, fast system monitoring tool with a clean TUI.
 Monitor CPU, memory, processes, and network status in real-time.
 Similar to htop and procs but with a focus on simplicity and speed.
Priority: optional
